RailsAdmin::DashboardHelper
  #total_pdf_pages_processed
    returns the sum of page_count across all PDF jobs
  #pdf_pages_processed_today
    returns the sum of page_count for PDF jobs created today
  #pdf_processing_jobs_count
    returns the number of PDF jobs with processing status
  #sidekiq_dead_set_size
    returns the dead set size from Sidekiq

APIRemediationJob
  #perform
    when the job has a source url
      transfers the file from the given job's source URL to S3
      closes the temporarily downloaded file
      when the file has a special character
        saves that special character to the jobs filename
        strips the special character for object_key
        strips the special character for the s3 bucket
      when the unit quota would be exceeded
        fails the job and does not upload to S3
    when an error occurs while downloading the source file
      updates the status and metadata of the given job record
      queues up a notification about the status of the job
    when an error occurs while uploading the source file
      updates the status and metadata of the given job record
      queues up a notification about the status of the job
      closes the temporarily downloaded file
    when an error occurs while reading the pdf for page counting
      fails the job and does not upload to S3

ImageAltTextJob
  #perform
    when the job is called with job uuid and file
      calls the Alt Text gem
      initializes AltText::Client with ENV-based config
      updates the alt_text of the given image job record
    when an error occurs while uploading the image file
      updates the status and metadata of the given image job record

RemediationStatusNotificationJob
  #perform
    when the given job is completed
      POSTs a success notification to the job's webhook endpoint
    when the given job has failed
      POSTs a failure notification to the job's webhook endpoint

AzureOidcConfig
  .redirect_uri_for
    when no forwarded headers are present
      builds a redirect_uri using the request scheme, host, and callback path
    when HTTP_X_FORWARDED_HOST is set
      prefers HTTP_X_FORWARDED_HOST
    when HTTP_X_FORWARDED_SERVER is set and HTTP_X_FORWARDED_HOST is not set
      uses HTTP_X_FORWARDED_SERVER
    when both HTTP_X_FORWARDED_HOST and HTTP_X_FORWARDED_SERVER are set
      prefers HTTP_X_FORWARDED_HOST over HTTP_X_FORWARDED_SERVER
  .issuer_for
    transforms an Azure v2.0 authorize endpoint into an issuer URL
    returns nil when the endpoint is nil
    returns the original string when it does not match the expected pattern

HealthChecks::QueueDeadSetCheck
  #check
    passes when deadset empty
    fails when deadset has jobs

